<view class="card">
  <view class="field">
    <text class="label">桌号</text>
    <input class="input" value="{{tableNo}}" placeholder="如 1 / A1" bindinput="onTableNo" />
  </view>
  <view class="btn-primary gen {{generating ? 'disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onGenerate">生成桌码</view>
</view>

<view class="card" wx:if="{{fileID}}">
  <image
    class="qr"
    src="{{fileID}}"
    mode="aspectFit"
    show-menu-by-longpress
    bindlongpress="onLongPress"
  />
  <view class="tip">长按可保存到相册,打印后张贴到对应餐桌。</view>
</view>

<view class="card tip-card">
  <view class="tip">说明:桌码需在小程序发布后扫码才能进入点餐页;开发期请在开发者工具中设置"编译模式 → 启动参数 scene=t%3D{{tableNo || '1'}}"模拟扫码。</view>
</view>
